WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.467
- So Jayne we have the pandemic,

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:04.597
we have the Black Lives Matter movement,

00:00:04.597 --> 00:00:06.160
there's just a lot of change.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.410
And I think that if we do it right,

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:11.010
it's a change in a great direction,

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:14.760
and I feel like it's been needed
to happen for generations.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:18.210
But I was just curious how you
were processing everything?

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.350
- Well, you know, there's
this thing called Twitter

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:23.020
and it's a double-edged sword.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:24.029
- Anywhere.

00:00:24.029 --> 00:00:25.770
I've laughed, I've never laughed harder,

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.560
than when I go through my Twitter feed,

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.820
I've never felt as heartbroken,

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.370
as when I go through my Twitter feed.

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:33.890
I've never been as angry.

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:34.723
(laughing)

00:00:34.723 --> 00:00:35.556
And that's the worst part.

00:00:35.556 --> 00:00:39.670
So, it's kind of, that's
where I get my news.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:41.780
It's been a bit of an addiction for me

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:44.120
and I'm suffering a little bit over it.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.653
So I'm not sure where to put it,

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:51.270
there is just so much
going on and I feel like

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:54.460
I gotta know what it is and
I've gotta understand it.

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.070
And I think that that's a healthy thing

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:57.270
because we are at a tipping point,

00:00:57.270 --> 00:01:02.010
this is a really tender
moment in our history,

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:05.790
in our nation's history, you know,

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:07.830
are we gonna survive this?

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:09.657
You know, the institutions

00:01:09.657 --> 00:01:12.010
and are we gonna tear each other apart?

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:15.740
I mean we're really at a tipping point.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:17.090
- [Kelly] I agree, I agree.

